<% session = @notification.notifiable -%>
Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,

<%= @notification.message %>
<% if session -%>

<% UnitHub::Notifications.session_details(session, at: @notification.created_at).each do |label, value| -%>
<%= label %>: <%= value %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% if @notification_url.present? -%>

Open the session: <%= @notification_url %>
<% end -%>

You are getting this because session reminders are on in your notification settings.
You can turn them off here:
<%= @unsubscribe_url %>
